{"summary":"吹火筒是《本草纲目》记载的器物，用于治疗小儿阴部被蚯蚓咬伤肿胀，方法是由女性用筒吹肿处，即可消肿。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）","translation":"出自《纲目》。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":"小儿阴，被蚯蚓呵肿，令妇人以筒吹其肿处，即消（时珍）。","translation":"小儿阴部被蚯蚓咬伤肿胀，让女性用筒吹患处，立即消肿。（时珍）"},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E6%9C%8D%E5%99%A8%E9%83%A8#吹火筒","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:40.129Z"}